Lake fetches the foundation at that commit and takes the cpap-np-hardness package from
this repository. The generated Challenge.lean specification reproduces the planarity
definitions of the NP-completeness foundation (iterate through PlanarGraph) verbatim,
and the definitions of the cycle-path assignment problem, of pairCount and of
the vertex relabelling verbatim from the cpap-np-hardness library (adding
documentation comments where that library has none), as its docs/FOUNDATION.md
asks downstream developments to do.
